            "notes": "Board an early morning direct flight from Mumbai (BOM) to Udaipur Maharana Pratap Airport (UDR), taking just 1 hour and 25 minutes. Enjoy spectacular aerial views descending over the emerald waters of Lake Pichola and the jagged ridges of the Aravalli range.",
