            "notes": "Feast on the legendary unlimited pure-vegetarian thali at Natraj Dining Hall: piping hot phulkas brushed with pure desi ghee, crispy dal baati churma, authentic Rajasthani gatta curry, savory ker sangri, sweet Gujarati kadhi, spicy marwari dal, dhokla, and refreshing smoked chaas (buttermilk).",
