            "notes": "Board an evening motorboat from Bansi Ghat jetty as the late afternoon light turns golden. Cruise past the floating white marble vision of Taj Lake Palace and dock at Jagmandir Island Palace. Stroll through the 17th-century marble courtyards lined with majestic life-sized stone elephants, the domed Gul Mahal pavilion, and landscaped gardens reflecting the tranquil blue waters.",
